\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   My Jesus, suffered pains in this world
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Before He went unto Heaven.
\par Through your death and again your sufferings
\par Has given us a gift so great
\par Your children who do believe in you
\par Give thanks to you for your mercies always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Whenever we partake in this food,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Refreshed in mind your precious death
\par We see your love and your compassion
\par In such a death you made for us.
\par Your blood, your suffering and your death
\par We see it so anew into our heart.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  The rope of love that binds us to you
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 You've made it strong to bind us all
\par The friendship that exist between us
\par Have come to be renewed again
\par And so in such a great  time as this
\par You and us have in one flesh to become.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  This kind of bread to us will nurture
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj And this blood too will strengthen us
\par And so when we eat and take this drink
\par Our spirit get eternal life
\par We get so strong and so powerful,
\par And fight to become so victorious.
\par \pard  \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

